# Keep the build context small AND keep local dev files out of the image.
# Excluding .env/.env.local is critical: otherwise the local VITE_API_URL would
# leak into the production build and override the relative same-origin base.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.DS_Store
*.log
.git
.gitignore
backend/static
pipeline
docs
